#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to rxvt-unicode"
msgstr "Introdução ao rxvt-unicode"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>rxvt-unicode</application> is a clone of the terminal emulator "
"<application>rxvt</application>, an X Window System terminal emulator which "
"includes support for XFT and Unicode."
msgstr ""
"<application>rxvt-unicode</application> é um clone do emulador de terminal "
"<application>rxvt</application>, um emulador de terminal do Sistema de "
"Janelas X que inclui suporte para XFT e Unicode."

#.  https://github.com/Perl/perl5/issues/12349
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:39
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Please be aware that <application>rxvt-unicode</application> is affected by "
"an issue in <application>perl</application> where the SIGFPE handler is set "
"to SIG_IGN (i.e. the signal is ignored).  If you are building an LFS system "
"from within <command>urxvt</command> and running the test suites, tests in "
"<application>bash</application> which test raising this signal will fail."
msgstr ""
"Por favor, esteja ciente de que o <application>rxvt-unicode</application> é "
"afetado por um problema no <application>perl</application> onde o manuseador"
" SIGFPE esteja configurado como SIG_IGN (ou seja, o sinal é ignorado). Se "
"você estiver construindo um sistema LFS a partir do <command>urxvt</command>"
" e executando as suítes de teste, os testes em "
"<application>bash</application> cujo teste gere esse sinal falharão."

