#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed '/interpolation/,+7d' -i src/rxvtutil.h</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed '/interpolation/,+7d' -i src/rxvtutil.h</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>rxvt-unicode</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>rxvt-unicode</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --enable-everything &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --enable-everything &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-everything</parameter>: Add support for all non-"
"multichoice options. Details about the different options can be found in the"
" file <filename>README.configure</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-everything</parameter>: Adiciona suporte para todas as "
"opções que não sejam de múltipla escolha. Detalhes a respeito das diferentes"
" opções podem ser encontrados no arquivo "
"<filename>README.configure</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid "<option>--disable-xft</option>: Remove support for Xft fonts."
msgstr "<option>--disable-xft</option>: Remove o suporte para fontes Xft."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-perl</option>: Disable the embedded "
"<application>Perl</application> interpreter."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-perl</option>: Desabilita o interpretador "
"<application>Perl</application> incorporado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-afterimage</option>: Remove support for libAfterImage."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-afterimage</option>: Remove o suporte para libAfterImage."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring rxvt-unicode"
msgstr "Configurando rxvt-unicode"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>rxvt-unicode</application> terminal emulator uses the "
"resource class <classname>URxvt</classname> and the resource name "
"<classname>urxvt</classname>. You can add X resource definitions to a user's"
" <filename>~/.Xresources</filename> or <filename>~/.Xdefaults</filename> "
"files or to the system-wide <filename>/etc/X11/app-defaults/URxvt</filename>"
" file. The following example will load the <classname>matcher</classname> "
"<application>Perl</application> extension (assuming "
"<application>Perl</application> support wasn't disabled), which enables a "
"left button click to open an underlined URL in the specified browser, sets a"
" background and foreground color and loads an Xft font (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"O emulador de terminal <application>rxvt-unicode</application> usa a classe "
"de recurso <classname>URxvt</classname> e o nome de recurso "
"<classname>urxvt</classname>. Você pode adicionar definições de recursos do "
"X aos arquivos <filename>~/.Xresources</filename> ou "
"<filename>~/.Xdefaults</filename> de um(a) usuário(a) ou ao arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/X11/app-defaults/URxvt</filename> abrangente a todo o "
"sistema. O exemplo a seguir carregará a extensão do "
"<classname>matcher</classname> do <application>Perl</application> (assumindo"
" que o suporte <application>Perl</application> não foi desabilitado), o que "
"habilita que um clique com o botão esquerdo abra um URL sublinhado no "
"navegador especificado, configure uma cor de plano de fundo e de primeiro "
"plano e carregue uma fonte Xft (como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:171
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/app-defaults/URxvt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>! Use the specified colour as the windows background colour [default white]\n"
"URxvt*background: black\n"
"\n"
"! Use the specified colour as the windows foreground colour [default black]\n"
"URxvt*foreground: yellow\n"
"\n"
"! Select the fonts to be used. This is a comma separated list of font names\n"
"URxvt*font: xft:Monospace:pixelsize=18\n"
"\n"
"! Comma-separated list(s) of perl extension scripts (default: \"default\")\n"
"URxvt*perl-ext: matcher\n"
"\n"
"! Specifies the program to be started with a URL argument. Used by\n"
"URxvt*url-launcher: firefox\n"
"\n"
"! When clicked with the mouse button specified in the \"matcher.button\" resource\n"
"! (default 2, or middle), the program specified in the \"matcher.launcher\"\n"
"! resource (default, the \"url-launcher\" resource, \"sensible-browser\") will be\n"
"! started with the matched text as first argument.\n"
"! Below, default modified to mouse left button.\n"
"URxvt*matcher.button:     1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/X11/app-defaults/URxvt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>! Use a cor especificada como a cor de plano de fundo de janelas [padrão branca]\n"
"URxvt*background: black\n"
"\n"
"! Use a cor especificada como a cor de primeiro plano de janelas [padrão preta]\n"
"URxvt*foreground: yellow\n"
"\n"
"! Selecione as fontes a serem usadas. Esta é uma lista separada por vírgulas de nomes de fontes\n"
"URxvt*font: xft:Monospace:pixelsize=18\n"
"\n"
"! Lista(s) separada(s) por vírgulas de conjuntos de comandos sequenciais de extensão Perl (padrão: \"default\")\n"
"URxvt*perl-ext: matcher\n"
"\n"
"! Especifica o aplicativo a ser iniciado com um argumento URL.\n"
"URxvt*url-launcher: firefox\n"
"\n"
"! Quando clicado com o botão de mouse especificado no recurso \"matcher.button\"\n"
"! (padrão 2, ou meio), o aplicativo especificado no recurso \"matcher.launcher\"\n"
"! (padrão, o recurso \"url-launcher\", \"sensible-browser\" ) será iniciado com o\n"
"! texto correspondente como primeiro argumento.\n"
"! Abaixo, padrão modificado para botão esquerdo de mouse.\n"
"URxvt*matcher.button:     1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:196
#, xml-text
msgid "In order to view the defined X resources, issue:"
msgstr "Para a finalidade de visualizar os recursos definidos do X, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:199
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>xrdb -query</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>xrdb -query</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to add the modifications of the new user configuration file, "
"keeping previously X configurations (of course, unless you are changing any "
"on previously define), issue:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de adicionar as modificações do novo arquivo de "
"configuração do(a) usuário(a), mantendo as configurações anteriores do X (é "
"claro, a menos que você esteja mudando alguma definida anteriormente), "
"emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:207
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>xrdb -merge ~/.Xresources</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>xrdb -merge ~/.Xresources</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>rxvt-unicode</application> application can also run in a "
"daemon mode, which makes it possible to open multiple terminal windows "
"within the same process. The <command>urxvtc</command> client then connects "
"to the <command>urxvtd</command> daemon and requests a new terminal window."
"  Use this option with caution. If the daemon crashes, all the running "
"processes in the terminal windows are terminated."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo <application>rxvt-unicode</application> também pode ser "
"executado em modo de processo de segundo plano, o que torna possível abrir "
"múltiplas janelas de terminal dentro do mesmo processo. O cliente "
"<command>urxvtc</command> então se conecta ao processo de segundo plano "
"<command>urxvtd</command> e solicita uma nova janela de terminal. Use essa "
"opção com cuidado. Se o processo de segundo plano travar, todos os processos"
" em execução nas janelas do terminal serão terminados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can start the <command>urxvtd</command> daemon in the system or personal"
" startup <command>X</command> session script (e.g., "
"<filename>~/.xinitrc</filename>) by adding the following lines near the top "
"of the script:"
msgstr ""
"Você consegue iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>urxvtd</command> "
"no conjunto de comandos sequenciais do sistema ou pessoal de inicialização "
"de sessão do <command>X</command> (por exemplo, "
"<filename>~/.xinitrc</filename>) adicionando as seguintes linhas perto o "
"topo do conjunto de comandos sequenciais:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:226
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput><literal># Start the urxvtd daemon\n"
"urxvtd -q -f -o &amp;</literal></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><literal># Inicia o processo de segundo plano urxvtd.\n"
"urxvtd -q -f -o &amp;</literal></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For more information, examine the <command>urxvt</command>, "
"<command>urxvtd</command>, <command>urxvtc</command>, and "
"<filename>urxvtperl</filename> man pages."
msgstr ""
"Para mais informações, examine as páginas de manual "
"<command>urxvt</command>, <command>urxvtd</command>, "
"<command>urxvtc</command> e <filename>urxvtperl</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you use a Desktop Environment, a menu entry can be included, issuing, as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você usa um Ambiente de Área de Trabalho, uma entrada de menu pode ser "
"incluída, emitindo-se, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:240
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/urxvt.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Name=Rxvt-Unicode Terminal\n"
"Comment=Use the command line\n"
"GenericName=Terminal\n"
"Exec=urxvt\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=utilities-terminal\n"
"Categories=GTK;Utility;TerminalEmulator;\n"
"#StartupNotify=true\n"
"Keywords=console;command line;execute;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"update-desktop-database -q</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/urxvt.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Name=Rxvt-Unicode Terminal\n"
"Comment=Use a linha de comandos\n"
"GenericName=Terminal\n"
"Exec=urxvt\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=utilities-terminal\n"
"Categories=GTK;Utility;TerminalEmulator;\n"
"#StartupNotify=true\n"
"Keywords=console;command line;execute;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"update-desktop-database -q</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/rxvt-unicode.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For that, you need <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> and at least one "
"of <xref linkend=\"gnome-icon-theme\"/>, <xref linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/> "
"and <xref linkend=\"lxde-icon-theme\"/>. Uncomment the line with "
"<quote>StartupNotify=true</quote> if <xref linkend=\"startup-"
"notification\"/> is installed."
msgstr ""
"Para isso, você precisa do <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> e, pelo "
"menos, um dos <xref linkend=\"gnome-icon-theme\"/>, <xref linkend=\"oxygen-"
"icons\"/> e <xref linkend=\"lxde-icon-theme\"/>. Descomente a linha com "
"<quote>StartupNotify=true</quote> se o <xref linkend=\"startup-"
"notification\"/> estiver instalado."

